{"id":"u40","kelas":11,"no":6,"judul":"Surat Lamaran dan CV","title":"Application Letter and CV","emoji":"💼","ringkas":"Menulis surat lamaran dan riwayat hidup","ready":true,"goals":["memahami tujuan dan bagian-bagian **application letter** (surat lamaran kerja)","memahami isi **CV / resume**: data pribadi, pendidikan, pengalaman, keterampilan, dan referensi","memakai ungkapan formal: [[I am writing to apply for ...]], [[I would like to apply for ...]], [[I look forward to ...]]","menyebutkan kualifikasi, pengalaman, dan keterampilan dengan kalimat yang meyakinkan","memakai **simple present**, **simple past**, dan **present perfect** dalam surat lamaran","menulis surat lamaran dan CV sederhana"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Suatu hari kamu akan melamar magang atau pekerjaan. Perusahaan biasanya meminta dua dokumen: **application letter** (surat lamaran) dan **CV** (riwayat hidup). Surat lamaran yang baik **sopan, singkat, dan meyakinkan**. Di unit ini kamu belajar membaca dan menulis keduanya."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Bagian application letter","table":[["Bagian","Isi","Contoh"],["**Heading**","alamat dan tanggal","[[Jl. Melati 12, Bandung, 5 May 2026]]"],["**Inside address**","penerima surat","[[The Human Resources Manager, PT Maju Jaya]]"],["**Salutation**","salam pembuka","[[Dear Sir or Madam,]] / [[Dear Mr. Adi,]]"],["**Opening**","tujuan menulis dan sumber lowongan","[[I am writing to apply for the position of Office Assistant.]]"],["**Body**","kualifikasi, pengalaman, keterampilan","[[I graduated from SMK Negeri 1 in 2025.]]"],["**Closing paragraph**","harapan dan terima kasih","[[I look forward to hearing from you.]]"],["**Complimentary close**","penutup surat","[[Yours faithfully,]] / [[Sincerely,]]"],["**Signature**","tanda tangan dan nama","[[Dina Putri]]"]]},{"t":"warn","title":"Salam dan penutup harus serasi","text":"Jika tidak tahu nama penerima: [[Dear Sir or Madam,]] → [[Yours faithfully,]]. Jika tahu nama: [[Dear Mr. Adi,]] → [[Yours sincerely,]]."},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Bagian CV","table":[["Bagian","Isi"],["**Personal data**","nama, alamat, telepon, email, tanggal lahir"],["**Objective**","tujuan karier singkat"],["**Education**","riwayat pendidikan, dari yang terbaru"],["**Work experience**","pekerjaan atau magang, dari yang terbaru"],["**Skills**","keterampilan: komputer, bahasa, komunikasi"],["**Achievements**","prestasi atau penghargaan"],["**References**","orang yang bisa dihubungi untuk rekomendasi"]]},{"t":"vocab","title":"3. Kosakata penting","items":[{"en":"apply for","id":"melamar","ex":"I would like to apply for this job."},{"en":"application letter","id":"surat lamaran","ex":"She wrote an application letter."},{"en":"vacancy","id":"lowongan","ex":"There is a vacancy for a cashier."},{"en":"position","id":"posisi / jabatan","ex":"I want to apply for the position of receptionist."},{"en":"qualification","id":"kualifikasi","ex":"Her qualifications are suitable."},{"en":"experience","id":"pengalaman","ex":"I have two years of experience."},{"en":"skill","id":"keterampilan","ex":"Communication is an important skill."},{"en":"graduate","id":"lulus","ex":"I graduated from senior high school in 2025."},{"en":"enclose","id":"melampirkan","ex":"I enclose my CV."},{"en":"attach","id":"melampirkan (surel)","ex":"Please find my CV attached."},{"en":"interview","id":"wawancara","ex":"I am available for an interview."},{"en":"available","id":"tersedia / bersedia","ex":"I am available to start next month."},{"en":"reference","id":"referensi","ex":"My teacher can be my reference."},{"en":"responsible","id":"bertanggung jawab","ex":"I am a responsible person."},{"en":"fluent","id":"lancar","ex":"I am fluent in English."},{"en":"candidate","id":"pelamar / kandidat","ex":"She is a good candidate."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"4. Ungkapan formal","table":[["Fungsi","Ungkapan"],["Membuka","[[I am writing to apply for the position of ... advertised in ...]]"],["Membuka","[[I would like to apply for the position of ...]]"],["Menyebut kualifikasi","[[I graduated from ... in ...]] / [[I hold a ... diploma.]]"],["Menyebut pengalaman","[[I have worked as ... for ... years.]] / [[I did an internship at ...]]"],["Menyebut keterampilan","[[I am able to ...]] / [[I am skilled in ...]] / [[I am fluent in ...]]"],["Melampirkan","[[I enclose my CV.]] / [[Please find my CV attached.]]"],["Menutup","[[I look forward to hearing from you.]] / [[Thank you for your time and consideration.]]"],["Wawancara","[[I am available for an interview at any time.]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"5. Tense yang dipakai","table":[["Tense","Dipakai untuk","Contoh"],["**Simple present**","keadaan sekarang, sifat, keterampilan","[[I am hard-working and responsible.]]"],["**Simple past**","pendidikan dan pengalaman yang sudah selesai","[[I graduated in 2025.]] / [[I worked as a cashier.]]"],["**Present perfect**","pengalaman sampai sekarang","[[I have worked as a tutor for two years.]]"],["**Future (would)**","kesopanan","[[I would be grateful for the opportunity.]]"]]},{"t":"tip","title":"Gunakan bahasa formal","text":"Hindari singkatan seperti [[I'm]], [[I'd]], dan kata santai seperti [[hi]], [[thanks]]. Tulis [[I am]], [[I would]], [[Dear ...]], [[Thank you]]. Tulis juga hanya **fakta yang benar** tentang dirimu."},{"t":"dialog","title":"Teks 1: Application Letter","lines":[{"who":"Letter","en":"Jl. Melati 12, Bandung. 5 May 2026.","id":"Jl. Melati 12, Bandung. 5 Mei 2026."},{"who":"Letter","en":"The Human Resources Manager, PT Maju Jaya, Jl. Merdeka 20, Bandung.","id":"Manajer Sumber Daya Manusia, PT Maju Jaya, Jl. Merdeka 20, Bandung."},{"who":"Letter","en":"Dear Sir or Madam,","id":"Yth. Bapak/Ibu,"},{"who":"Letter","en":"I am writing to apply for the position of Office Assistant advertised on your website on 1 May.","id":"Saya menulis untuk melamar posisi Asisten Kantor yang diiklankan di situs Anda pada 1 Mei."},{"who":"Letter","en":"I graduated from SMK Negeri 1 Bandung in 2025 with a major in Office Administration. I did an internship at a travel agency for three months, and I am skilled in using Microsoft Office. I am also fluent in English.","id":"Saya lulus dari SMK Negeri 1 Bandung pada 2025 jurusan Administrasi Perkantoran. Saya magang di biro perjalanan selama tiga bulan, dan saya terampil memakai Microsoft Office. Saya juga lancar berbahasa Inggris."},{"who":"Letter","en":"I enclose my CV for your consideration. I am available for an interview at any time. I look forward to hearing from you.","id":"Saya lampirkan CV saya untuk pertimbangan Anda. Saya bersedia diwawancarai kapan saja. Saya menantikan kabar dari Anda."},{"who":"Letter","en":"Yours faithfully, Dina Putri","id":"Hormat saya, Dina Putri"}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog: Menyiapkan lamaran","lines":[{"who":"Dina","en":"Mr. Adi, I want to apply for a part-time job at a bookshop. What should I include in my letter?","id":"Pak Adi, saya ingin melamar kerja paruh waktu di toko buku. Apa yang harus saya tulis di surat?"},{"who":"Mr. Adi","en":"First, say which position you are applying for. Then write your education, experience, and skills.","id":"Pertama, sebutkan posisi yang kamu lamar. Lalu tulis pendidikan, pengalaman, dan keterampilanmu."},{"who":"Dina","en":"Should I attach my CV?","id":"Apakah saya harus melampirkan CV?"},{"who":"Mr. Adi","en":"Yes. Also, use formal language and check your spelling.","id":"Ya. Juga, pakai bahasa formal dan periksa ejaanmu."}]},{"t":"summary","items":["Surat lamaran: heading, alamat penerima, salutation, opening, body, closing, complimentary close, signature.","CV: personal data, objective, education, experience, skills, references.","Ungkapan: [[I am writing to apply for ...]], [[I enclose ...]], [[I look forward to hearing from you.]]","Pakai bahasa formal; salam serasi dengan penutup ([[Dear Sir or Madam]] → [[Yours faithfully]])."]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kosakata dengan artinya:","pairs":[["apply for","melamar"],["vacancy","lowongan"],["position","posisi"],["experience","pengalaman"],["skill","keterampilan"]],"exp":"Kosakata dasar surat lamaran.","k":"0f885dc6"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kosakata dengan artinya:","pairs":[["graduate","lulus"],["enclose","melampirkan"],["interview","wawancara"],["reference","referensi"],["fluent","lancar"]],"exp":"Kosakata surat lamaran.","k":"7ad85179"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan bagian CV dengan isinya:","pairs":[["Education","riwayat pendidikan"],["Skills","keterampilan"],["References","orang yang merekomendasikan"],["Personal data","nama dan alamat"]],"exp":"Bagian CV.","k":"a2bc3b8d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Tujuan application letter adalah...","options":["melamar pekerjaan","mengundang ke pesta","menceritakan dongeng","memberi resep"],"answer":0,"exp":"Application letter = surat lamaran.","k":"f19e0d70"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Salam yang tepat jika nama penerima tidak diketahui adalah...","options":["Dear Sir or Madam,","Hi guys,","Hey,","Dear friend,"],"answer":0,"exp":"Formal dan netral.","k":"f32cfe55"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Penutup yang serasi dengan \"Dear Sir or Madam\" adalah...","options":["Yours faithfully,","See you,","Bye,","Love,"],"answer":0,"exp":"Dear Sir or Madam → Yours faithfully.","k":"63b052b8"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Penutup yang serasi dengan \"Dear Mr. Adi\" adalah...","options":["Yours sincerely,","Yours faithfully,","Bye,","Cheers,"],"answer":0,"exp":"Dear + nama → Yours sincerely.","k":"f87755ac"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat pembuka yang paling tepat adalah...","options":["I am writing to apply for the position of cashier.","Hi, I want a job.","Give me a job.","I like your shop."],"answer":0,"exp":"Formal dan jelas.","k":"d8dbd46a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang formal?","options":["I would be grateful for the opportunity.","I'd love to get the job, thanks!","Gimme a chance.","Hope you're cool with it."],"answer":0,"exp":"Bahasa formal tanpa singkatan.","k":"42605e6c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat untuk melampirkan CV adalah...","op